# Netdata-specific, NON-SECRET config. This file IS committed.
#
# Shared values (TZ/CONFIG_ROOT/DATA_ROOT/ADMIN_DOMAIN) live in
# ../../common.env.
#
# Not claimed to Netdata Cloud on purpose. A claimed agent makes the local
# dashboard ask for a Netdata Cloud sign-in on every visit, and Authentik
# already guards this route. The agent WAS claimed through the UI at some
# point and was unclaimed again on 2026-11-23 (cloud.d/ and
# registry/netdata.public.unique.id deleted). The old claim files are in
# ${CONFIG_ROOT}/netdata/cloud-claim-backup-2026-11-23/.
#
# If the dashboard shows a "Connect to Cloud" or sign-in prompt again, do not
# click Connect. That re-claims the agent.

# Nothing else Netdata-specific needed yet.
